# The soak round (make soak, TestSoak): the selftest's everyday paths again
# and again. App launches and exits, end-to-end encrypted chat over push,
# video calls out and in, a banner and the notification centre, a tombstone
# and its revival, a cellular call, SMS out and in, music in the background,
# the TypeScript calculator. A round starts on the standby screen and ends
# there with the apps it opened stopped, so the next starts them afresh.

== soak: chat over push
key f4
at sys.idle 5000
type /
type 鸿雁
key enter
wait 张三
type /
type 张三
key enter
key enter
wait 输入消息
type 你好
key enter
wait 收到：你好

== soak: video call out (consent on the first round only)
key f2
key-if enter 请求使用 3000
wait 端到端加密
frames 10
audio call
key f2
wait [视频通话

== soak: video call in, answered on the system screen
key down 12
type 视频
key enter
wait 好，我打给你
key f4
wait 邀请你视频通话 8000
key enter
wait 端到端加密
frames 10
key f2
wait [视频通话

== soak: banner and notification centre
key down 12
type 在吗
key enter
key f4
wait 收到：在吗
key up
wait 通知中心 8000
wait 收到：在吗
key enter
wait 输入消息

== soak: tombstone and revival
key f4
type /
type 鸿雁
key enter
wait 张三
type /
type 张三
key enter
key enter
wait 输入消息
type 明天见
key f4
at sys.idle
saved com.phone.chat
lowmem-kill com.phone.chat
appstate com.phone.chat stopped
key f3
wait 切换应用
wait 鸿雁
key enter
revived com.phone.chat
wait 明天见
key enter
wait 收到：明天见
key f4

== soak: cellular call
require-tel
key f4
type /
type 电话
key enter
wait 最近通话
type 94
wait 张三
key down
key enter
wait 正在呼叫
audio call
wait 通话中 6000
type m
wait 已静音
type h
wait 已保持
type h
wait 通话中
key end
wait 通话结束
audio idle
key f4

== soak: SMS out and in
require-tel
key f4
type /
type 短信
key enter
wait 新信息
key f2
wait 收件人号码
type 13800000003
key down
type nihao
key space
key down
key enter
wait 收到：你好
key esc
wait 新信息
key f4
tel sms 10086 【中国移动】流量提醒：本月已用 80%
wait 流量提醒
gone 流量提醒 8000

== soak: music in the background
require-audio
key f4
type /
type 音乐
key enter
wait 晨光
key enter
wait 播放中
audio media
freeze-after 1000
key f4
sleep 2000
appstate com.phone.music running
freeze-after 0
type /
type 音乐
key enter
wait 正在播放
key enter
wait 已暂停
key f4

== soak: calculator (TypeScript)
key f4
type /
type 计算器
key enter
wait 小数点
type 12
type *
type 30
key enter
wait = 42 8000
key f4

== soak: the round's apps stopped
appstop com.phone.chat
appstop com.phone.dialer
appstop com.phone.messages
appstop com.phone.music
appstop com.phone.calc
key f4
at sys.idle
